resize-gpu-bars (6.2) noble; urgency=medium

  * Packaging only (script unchanged, v6.1): dh_installsystemd --no-start.
    The 6.0 -> 6.1 upgrade started the unit because it was in the failed
    state, which unbound and re-initialised all four GPUs on a running box.
    The unit is now only enabled; it runs at the next boot, or on an explicit
    "systemctl start". postinst says so.

